The iostream destructor chain trips vtable-pointer bounds checks in
~basic_ios/~basic_iostream: devirtualized dispatch with unconstrained
vtable pointers (unmodeled facet constructors) runs ~basic_ios on
smaller objects.  Blocks cpp11_stream_setw and
cpp11_ofstream_from_string.
